{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the depths</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the last explorer of an ancient ocean, tasked with uncovering the lost songs of a forgotten people. The abyss holds sunken ruins, enigmatic creatures, and secrets buried deep in silence. Your mission: listen, observe, understand\u2026 and bring this world back to life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your only tools: your senses</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No weapons, no maps, no set path. Decode and harness the ancient songs to open new ways, soothe or command the creatures, and connect the scattered fragments of a world in decline. You are guided by your curiosity, your eyes, and your ears.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unravel its mysteries</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What happened to the ancient peoples? What lies beyond the currents no one has ever crossed? How can you find the lost songs\u2026 and learn to use them to control the creatures still roaming the depths? The answers await you, hidden within the ocean\u2019s whispers.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3930190?t=1762175394","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3930190?t=1762175394","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930190/df2c4c5b2fb20cb14a3a04ff46688f702c894f88/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762175394","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930190/df2c4c5b2fb20cb14a3a04ff46688f702c894f88/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762175394","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4109280,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the depths</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the last explorer of an ancient ocean, tasked with uncovering the lost songs of a forgotten people. The abyss holds sunken ruins, enigmatic creatures, and secrets buried deep in silence. Your mission: listen, observe, understand\u2026 and bring this world back to life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your only tools: your senses</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No weapons, no maps, no set path. Decode and harness the ancient songs to open new ways, soothe or command the creatures, and connect the scattered fragments of a world in decline. You are guided by your curiosity, your eyes, and your ears.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unravel its mysteries</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What happened to the ancient peoples? What lies beyond the currents no one has ever crossed? How can you find the lost songs\u2026 and learn to use them to control the creatures still roaming the depths? The answers await you, hidden within the ocean\u2019s whispers.</p>","developers":["Electric Dream"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930190/6d60c181a8734774ccd21825a4385c5b65e67a94/header.jpg?t=1762175394","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3930190/1620543678/78254a50e9519cb97b91e25260fa865f509cbeb0/1760536368/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760537910","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3930190/1620543678/78254a50e9519cb97b91e25260fa865f509cbeb0/1760536368/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760537910","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3930190/1620543678/78254a50e9519cb97b91e25260fa865f509cbeb0/1760536368/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760537910","id":257218321,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257218321/movie480.mp4?t=1760537910","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257218321/movie_max.mp4?t=1760537910"},"name":"Wavekin Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets